    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46870" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭper-sterno</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				strātum, 3, v. a., <i>to strew</i> or <i>spread upon</i>,
				<i>to spread over</i>, <i>cover
			over</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pavimenta testacea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					1, 6, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">superstrati cumuli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 10, 29, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fossam ponte solubili,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 16, 8, 10</span></i>
			.</div>
